  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<color=#F57361>\xBB</color>  <b>Runtime API:</b> player.Damage / Heal
    / Spend(\"Stamina\", 30) / Refill(\"DarkMana\", 15) / AddLevel / UpgradeStat(\"Vitality\");
    enemy.ApplyDamage(new RpgDamageInfo(40, \"Fire\", player)); AddDamageModifier;
    DamageApplied event.\n<color=#F57361>\xBB</color>  <b>Scene workflow:</b> Select
    Rpg Demo Player (Template field). Rows carry RpgResourceBinding / RpgStatBinding,
    NoCode buttons carry RpgNoCodeAction, the Low HP row carries a NeoCondition.\n<color=#F57361>\xBB</color> 
    <b>Verification:</b> Damage the player below 35% HP: the Low HP row turns red
    without code. Level Up grants a point; Upgrade Vitality adds +15 Max HP."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
